# PRD Task Completion Workflow

- Before starting any task, read `PRD.md`.
- Before implementing, state which PRD task is being worked on.
- Before implementing, state the acceptance criteria for that task.
- After code is written and confirmed working, immediately update `PRD.md` checkboxes from `[ ]` to `[x]` for the completed item.
- Never mark a parent task complete unless all of its subtasks are complete.
- Never mark any task complete unless it is fully implemented and confirmed working.
